      "code": "def build_agent(sandbox):\n    # Create base beams (horizontal)\n    base_beam1 = sandbox.add_beam(x=17.5, y=6.0, width=5.0, height=1.0)\n    base_beam2 = sandbox.add_beam(x=22.5, y=6.0, width=5.0, height=1.0)\n    \n    # Create vertical beams (connecting base to middle/top)\n    vertical_beam1 = sandbox.add_beam(x=17.5, y=6.0, width=1.0, height=6.0)\n    vertical_beam2 = sandbox.add_beam(x=22.5, y=6.0, width=1.0, height=6.0)\n    \n    # Create middle horizontal beam\n    middle_beam = sandbox.add_beam(x=20.0, y=9.0, width=5.0, height=1.0)\n    \n    # Create top horizontal beam\n    top_beam = sandbox.add_beam(x=20.0, y=12.0, width=5.0, height=1.0)\n    \n    # Connect base beams to vertical beams\n    sandbox.add_joint(base_beam1, vertical_beam1, (17.5, 6.0))\n    sandbox.add_joint(base_beam2, vertical_beam2, (22.5, 6.0))\n    \n    # Connect vertical beams to middle beam\n    sandbox.add_joint(vertical_beam1, middle_beam, (17.5, 9.0))\n    sandbox.add_joint(vertical_beam2, middle_beam, (22.5, 9.0))\n    \n    # Connect middle beam to top beam\n    sandbox.add_joint(middle_beam, top_beam, (20.0, 10.5))\n    \n    # Anchor base beams to the floor\n    sandbox.add_joint(base_beam1, None, (15.0, 6.0))\n    sandbox.add_joint(base_beam1, None, (20.0, 6.0))\n    sandbox.add_joint(base_beam2, None, (20.0, 6.0))\n    sandbox.add_joint(base_beam2, None, (25.0, 6.0))\n    \n    return base_beam1\n\ndef agent_action(sandbox, agent_body, step_count):\n    pass",
